#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:699
msgid "Working directory -> `git add` -> staging -> `git commit` -> repository; `status`, `log`, `.gitignore`"
msgstr "Работна директория -> `git add` -> staging -> `git commit` -> repository; `status`, `log`, `.gitignore`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:700
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:701
msgid "The language of the web, also in Node.js and inside other programs (rule engines); standard: ECMAScript, a new version every year"
msgstr "Езикът на уеба, също и в Node.js и в други програми (rule engines); стандарт: ECMAScript, нова версия всяка година"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:702
msgid "Running it"
msgstr "Изпълнение"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:702
msgid "The Run buttons of this site; the browser console (`F12`); `node file.js` in the terminal"
msgstr "Бутоните Run на този сайт; конзолата на браузъра (`F12`); `node file.js` в терминала"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:703
msgid "How it runs"
msgstr "Как се изпълнява"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:703
msgid "Engine (V8): tokens -> AST -> bytecode -> hot code; the environment gives `console`, `document`, `emit`"
msgstr "Engine (V8): tokens -> AST -> bytecode -> горещ код; средата дава `console`, `document`, `emit`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:704
msgid "Structure"
msgstr "Структура"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:704
msgid "Statements run top to bottom, end with `;`; expressions give values; blocks `{ }`; comments `//`"
msgstr "Statements се изпълняват отгоре надолу и завършват с `;`; expressions дават стойности; блокове `{ }`; коментари `//`"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:705
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Variable"

#. table cell
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:705
msgid "A name for a value in memory; details in lecture 2"
msgstr "Име на стойност в паметта; подробности в лекция 2"

#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:707
msgid "Homework"
msgstr "Домашно"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:709
msgid "Install Node.js (LTS), VSCode and Git, and create a GitHub account (if you do not have one). Check the versions in a terminal."
msgstr "Инсталирайте Node.js (LTS), VSCode и Git и си създайте акаунт в GitHub (ако нямате). Проверете версиите в терминал."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:711
msgid "Do steps 2-6 of the practice, if you did not finish them in class: a `hello.js` in a repository of your own on GitHub, Labs cloned, Homework set up with `upstream` and `origin` (see the [Homework README](https://github.com/ivapopova-courses/JS-Basics-Practical-IBM-Homework#readme))."
msgstr "Направете стъпки 2-6 от упражненията, ако не сте ги довършили в час: `hello.js` във ваше собствено repository в GitHub, клониран Labs, Homework настроен с `upstream` и `origin` (вижте [README на Homework](https://github.com/ivapopova-courses/JS-Basics-Practical-IBM-Homework#readme))."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:715
msgid "Spend 15 minutes in VSCode: the Command Palette, the shortcuts table of section 3, a color theme you like."
msgstr "Отделете 15 минути във VSCode: Command Palette, таблицата с клавишни комбинации от раздел 3, цветова тема, която ви харесва."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:717
msgid "Think about the course project: which product's reports would you start with?"
msgstr "Помислете за курсовия проект: с отчетите на кой продукт бихте започнали?"

#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:719
msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Още за четене"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:721
msgid "VSCode: [documentation](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs), [Basic editing](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/codebasics), [Using Git in VSCode](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/sourcecontrol/overview), [Extension Marketplace](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/extension-marketplace)"
msgstr "VSCode: [документация](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs), [Basic editing](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/codebasics), [Using Git in VSCode](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/sourcecontrol/overview), [Extension Marketplace](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/extension-marketplace)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:725
msgid "Git: [Pro Git book](https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2) (free; chapters 1-2 cover today), [Adding a local repository to GitHub](https://docs.github.com/en/migrations/importing-source-code/using-the-command-line-to-import-source-code/adding-locally-hosted-code-to-github), [Authenticating with the command line](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/about-authentication-to-github#authenticating-with-the-command-line)"
msgstr "Git: [книгата Pro Git](https://git-scm.com/book/en/v2) (безплатна; глави 1-2 покриват днешното), [Adding a local repository to GitHub](https://docs.github.com/en/migrations/importing-source-code/using-the-command-line-to-import-source-code/adding-locally-hosted-code-to-github), [Authenticating with the command line](https://docs.github.com/en/authentication/keeping-your-account-and-data-secure/about-authentication-to-github#authenticating-with-the-command-line)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:728
msgid "JavaScript: [MDN - What is JavaScript?](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Scripting/What_is_JavaScript), [javascript.info - An introduction](https://javascript.info/intro), [Node.js - Introduction](https://nodejs.org/en/learn/getting-started/introduction-to-nodejs)"
msgstr "JavaScript: [MDN - What is JavaScript?](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Core/Scripting/What_is_JavaScript), [javascript.info - An introduction](https://javascript.info/intro), [Node.js - Introduction](https://nodejs.org/en/learn/getting-started/introduction-to-nodejs)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:731
msgid "History: [JavaScript on Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript), [Brendan Eich](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brendan_Eich), [ECMA-262](https://ecma-international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-262/)"
msgstr "История: [JavaScript в Wikipedia](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript), [Brendan Eich](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brendan_Eich), [ECMA-262](https://ecma-international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-262/)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:733
msgid "The engine: [V8](https://v8.dev/)"
msgstr "Engine-ът: [V8](https://v8.dev/)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:735
msgid "**Next session:** variables, types and operators - `let` and `const`, numbers and strings, and turning the strings of a report into numbers."
msgstr "**Следващото занятие:** variables, типове и оператори - `let` и `const`, числа и strings и превръщане на strings от отчета в числа."

#~ msgid "`console.log(...)` prints its value - our main tool to see what a program does. `doc` is the sample device report; it is ready in every example on this site."
#~ msgstr "`console.log(...)` отпечатва стойността си - основният ни инструмент, за да видим какво прави една програма. `doc` е примерният отчет на устройство; той е готов във всеки пример на този сайт."

